<title>POLAND: Warta to receive PLN 12.8 mln tax refund.</title>
<headline>Warta to receive PLN 12.8 mln tax refund.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurance company Warta SA will get 12.8 million zlotys in interest on taxes overpaid in 1990-92, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It said it had received a tax office decision of the tax refund on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
